WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:35.397
"Good morning," said Mr. Grill.

2
00:00:35.398 --> 00:00:39.603
"We will do something new today!"

3
00:00:39.604 --> 00:00:43.427
"Will we go fast?" asked Zippy.

4
00:00:43.428 --> 00:00:45.965
He looked at Eddy and grinned.

5
00:00:45.966 --> 00:00:48.253
Eddy frowned.

6
00:00:48.254 --> 00:00:52.250
"Will we tell jokes?" asked Poppy.

7
00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:55.299
"Nope," said Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:09.300
"Follow me!"

9
00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:13.669
The teacher drove down the road.

10
00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.837
Eddy saw lots of trees.

11
00:01:16.838 --> 00:01:20.507
"Hmm," he thought.

12
00:01:20.508 --> 00:01:29.380
"Where are we going?"

13
00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:33.044
"We're here!" said Mr. Grill.

14
00:01:33.045 --> 00:01:37.877
Eddy saw a wide path.

15
00:01:37.878 --> 00:01:41.046
It led into the woods.

16
00:01:41.047 --> 00:01:43.630
Mr. Grill smiled.

17
00:01:43.631 --> 00:01:46.838
"We're going off-road!"

18
00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:49.016
Eddy smiled.

19
00:01:49.017 --> 00:01:51.606
"Wow!" he said.

20
00:01:51.607 --> 00:01:54.335
"Cool!" said Jeb.

21
00:01:54.336 --> 00:01:57.377
"Fun!" said Dipper.

22
00:01:57.378 --> 00:02:00.756
"Yay!" said Poppy.

23
00:02:00.757 --> 00:02:03.716
"I hope the path is bumpy!"

24
00:02:03.717 --> 00:02:06.130
Zippy frowned.

25
00:02:06.131 --> 00:02:09.667
"This stinks!" he cried.

26
00:02:09.668 --> 00:02:15.372
"I hate going off-road!"
